will result in the following SQL query being executed (parameter &amp;apos;QUERY&amp;apos;):






SELECT e.one, e.two FROM examples e WHERE e.one = &amp;apos;%QUERY&amp;apos; OR e.two LIKE &amp;apos;%QUERY&amp;apos;






