Incriminated code
org.springframework.validation.DataBinder.autoGrowNestedPaths is default true, it should be false instead.
Workarounds
In a controller : 






@InitBinder




public void initBinder(WebDataBinder binder) {




    binder.setAutoGrowNestedPaths(false);




}






