[a, b]    [a, a, b, b] =  [a, a, b, b]
and
[a, a, b, b]    [a, b] =  [a, b]
Expected behavior:
 [a, a, b, b]    [a, b] =  [a, b]
[a, b]    [a, a, b, b] =  [a, b]
Code demonstrating the problem.
